-cattle","in-hand-2SG.M","and","be_stolen.IPFV.3SG.M"],"tl":"The grazing and the fodder, the exhaustion, and the guarding, and the important thing these days is the question of safety, we don't have safety, the cattle that is in your hand might be stolen [any minute].","anchor":"langsci395-0068855083"},{"id":"langsci395-19d602cba7","tx":"w hāy ləbnayya bass әhəya təsraḥ bəlġanam kəllšāy mā ʕadha","sg":["w","hāy","l-əbnayya","bass","әhəya","təsraḥ","b-əl-ġanam","kəllšāy","mā","ʕad-ha"],"gl":["and","DEM","DEF-girl","but","3SG.F","graze.IPFV.3SG.F","with-DEF-sheep","everything","NEG","at-3SG.F"],"tl":"And this girl was always just grazing the sheep, she had nothing [else].","anchor":"langsci395-19d602cba7"},{"id":"langsci395-94b66f94d4","tx":"hāḏann ləhədūm","sg":["hāḏann","lə-hədūm"],"gl":["DEM.PL.F","DEF-clothes"],"tl":"these clothes","anchor":"langsci395-94b66f94d4"},{"id":"langsci395-501ecb0f3a","tx":"əḥna hāy əlʕarab hāy","sg":["əḥna","hāy","əl-ʕarab","hāy"],"gl":["1PL","DEM","DEF-arabs","DEM"],"tl":"we Arabs","anchor":"langsci395-501ecb0f3a"},{"id":"langsci395-33db893511","tx":"sittīn ḥōliyye","sg":["sittīn","ḥōliyye"],"gl":["sixty","young_female_water_buffalo"],"tl":"sixty [young female] water buffaloes","anchor":"langsci395-33db893511"},{"id":"langsci395-8aad4f15d0","tx":"sitt əšhur","sg":["sitt","əšhur"],"gl":["six","month.PL"],"tl":"six months","anchor":"langsci395-8aad4f15d0"},{"id":"langsci395-d41681aad3","tx":"gālat ʔāna ʔaḏ̣əllan bәhāḏa ġaṣәr māl əlmalək","sg":["gālat","ʔāna","ʔaḏ̣əllan","bә-hāḏa","ġaṣәr","māl","əl-malək"],"gl":["say.PFV.3SG.F","1SG","stay.IPFV.1SG","in-DEM.SG.M","castle","GL.SG.M","DEF-king"],"tl":"She said: “I will stay in this, the king's castle.”","anchor":"langsci395-d41681aad3"},{"id":"langsci395-7477c25004","tx":"w ənnōb tāli nrawwi əbṣīniyye","sg":["w","ənnōb","tāli","nrawwi","əb-ṣīniyye"],"gl":["and","then","next","form_balls.IPFV.1PL","on-tablet"],"tl":"…and then we form balls [of dough for baking bread] on the tablet.","anchor":"langsci395-7477c25004"},{"id":"langsci395-11e7611701","tx":"gabul ma čānu ystəfādūn ləbləbi","sg":["gabul","ma","čānu","ystəfādūn","ləbləbi"],"gl":["formerly","NEG","AUX.3PL.M","use.IPFV.3PL.M","chick_peas"],"tl":"In former times they didn't use chick peas [for cooking].","anchor":"langsci395-11e7611701"},{"id":"langsci395-d65bb90ad9","tx":"ġarafna ləlhōr gəmna ənḥušš","sg":["ġarafna","l-əl-hōr","gəmna","ənḥušš"],"gl":["row.PFV.1PL","to-DEF-marshland","AUX.1PL","cut_grass.IPFV.1PL"],"tl":"We rowed to the marshland [hōr], we started to cut grass.","anchor":"langsci395-d65bb90ad9"},{"id":"langsci395-440af8acb7","tx":"ətgūl әlli lyōm mā ətrūḥ ləššəġəl","sg":["ətgūl","әlli","lyōm","mā","ətrūḥ","l-əš-šəġəl"],"gl":["say.IPFV.3SG.F","that","today","NEG","go.IPFV.3SG.F","to-DEF-work"],"tl":"She says that today she won't go to work.","anchor":"langsci395-440af8acb7"},{"id":"langsci395-08393e9359","tx":"w maʕrūf ənnu məṯəl","sg":["w","maʕrūf","ənnu","məṯəl"],"gl":["and","known","that","for_example"],"tl":"And [it is] known that for example…","anchor":"langsci395-08393e9359"},{"id":"langsci395-d42888a2c3","tx":"gāl əlyōm māku ṭalʕa","sg":["gāl","əlyōm","māku","ṭalʕa"],"gl":["say.PFV.3SG.M","today","EXIST.NEG","going_out"],"tl":"He said that today there is no going out.","anchor":"langsci395-d42888a2c3"},{"id":"langsci395-768c6dc241","tx":"šəfətli maʕǧiza","sg":["šəfət-l-i","maʕǧiza"],"gl":["see.PFV.1SG-for-1SG","miracle"],"tl":"I saw a miracle.","anchor":"langsci395-768c6dc241"},{"id":"langsci395-ae8a81d9d4","tx":"əlḥaywāna nəḥlibha","sg":["əl-ḥaywāna","nəḥlib-ha"],"gl":["DEF-animal.SG","milk.IPFV.1PL-3SG.F"],"tl":"We milk the cattle.","anchor":"langsci395-ae8a81d9d4"},{"id":"langsci395-dd44761b38","tx":"ləbasne əxwīəṣātne ləbasne əḥžīəlātne yaʕni šīəlat balbūl ləbasne yaʕni əṭṭōg umāṣxa ləbasne","sg":["ləbasne","əxwīəṣāt-ne","ləbasne","əḥžīəlāt-ne","yaʕni","šīəla-t","balbūl","ləbasne","yaʕni","əṭ-ṭōg","u-māṣxa","ləbasne"],"gl":["wear.PFV.1PL","ring.DIM.PL-1PL","wear.PFV.1PL