d","DEF-spices"],"tl":"We take the chicken, in its belly we put some rice and raisins and black pepper and spices.","anchor":"langsci395-10207c66f0"},{"id":"langsci395-f8efd25621","tx":"waḷḷa dāyman hēč mā nilbas","sg":["waḷḷa","dāyman","hēč","mā","nilbas"],"gl":["by_god","always","like_this","NEG","dress.IPFV.1PL"],"tl":"It's not always that we dress like this.","anchor":"langsci395-f8efd25621"},{"id":"langsci395-588982447c","tx":"hāḏanni ṭəlyān ṭəli yṣīr","sg":["hāḏanni","ṭəlyān","ṭəli","yṣīr"],"gl":["DEM.PL.F","lamb.PL","lamb","COP"],"tl":"These are ṭəlyān [“lambs”], ṭəli [“lamb”] we call it.","anchor":"langsci395-588982447c"},{"id":"langsci395-63b2f014bf","tx":"hāy əlfaḥla yṣīr čibīre w hāy ənnaxla la zəġīre eh zəġīre taġrīban halgaddātha tṣīr nəfšəg gadd čaff īd hāy waḥdat ənnaṯye","sg":["hāy","əl-faḥla","yṣīr","čibīr-e","w","hāy","ən-naxla","la","zəġīr-e","eh","zəġīr-e","taġrīban","ha-l-gadd-āt-ha","tṣīr","nəfšəg","gadd","čaff","īd","hāy","waḥda-t","ən-naṯye"],"gl":["DEM","DEF-male_palm","become.IPFV.3SG.M","big-F","and","DEM","DEF-palm","no","small-F","yes","small-F","about","DEM-DEF-size-PL.F-3SG.F","become.IPFV.3SG.F","split.IPFV.1PL","size","palm","hand","DEM","thing-CS","DEF-female_palm"],"tl":"This male palm grows big, but this palm not, small, yes small, it becomes about this size, we split – as [big as] a hand – this thing of the female palm.","anchor":"langsci395-63b2f014bf"},{"id":"langsci395-b81b0c064b","tx":"gālha thəddīn hāḏ əlbīət w thəddīn hāy əddār w thəddīn hāy əddār bass hāy əddār lā thəddīnha","sg":["gāl-ha","thəddīn","hāḏ","əl-bīət","w","thəddīn","hāy","əd-dār","w","thəddīn","hāy","əd-dār","bass","hāy","əd-dār","lā","thəddīn-ha"],"gl":["tell.PFV.3SG.M-3SG.F","open.IPFV.2SG.F","DEM","DEF-house","and","open.IPFV.2SG.F","DEM","DEF-room","and","open.IPFV.2SG.F","DEM","DEF-room","but","DEM","DEF-room","NEG","open.IPFV.2SG.F-3SG.F"],"tl":"He said: “You [may] open this house, and you [may] open this room, and you [may] open this room, but don't yo